        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yusufu muyo mwanga Falao, nfalume wa Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya myaka mivili, Falao nkulota indoto. Muindoto aneyo álotile aimidìlè nnyenje muto wa Naili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkuvona ang'ombe saba vakatapêle na vanyetîle uvahuma mmuto na uvalya wahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga bada ya avala ang'ombe saba, nkuhumila ang'ombe vanji saba vahakalenge na vayandîle namene mmuto wa Naili, nkuimila nnyenje, pepi na avala vanyetîle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avala ang'ombe vayandîle namene nkuvalya avala ang'ombe saba vakatapêle na vanyetîle. Anepo Falao nkwimuka nnuwono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao palalite kavila, nkulota mwanda wavili. Nkulona mahahi saba makulungwa na lakatapêle ulahipuka nnupambahi lumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu nkuhipuka na mahahi lanji saba lachapakêle, layumîjwe na lipungo livêle na chitukuta namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Àlalá mahahi saba lachapakêle nkulamila àlalá mahahi saba makulungwa laumbalidîle ngano. Bahi Falao payumwike, nkumala kuva yavele indoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulyamba wake, Falao nkuva na lipamba namene, nkuvachema vahavi vammalele va ku Misili, pamo na vanu vavêle na lúnda, nkuvahaulila dindoto dyake, henga wala nanga munu kananga yumo anahulwile kunnyaulila mana lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi ayula nkwímilila nkulu wa vikimbilo vya nfalume nkunnyaulila Falao kuchidoni, “Nelo ngùlakumbukila makosa langu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maduva àlalá lunatuvisijije hwetu tuvatumishi vako, nangu chalumo na nkútaleka nkulu wa mikate, nkutuhungila nng'ande ya chitawala yanga Potifa, nkulu wa valinzi vako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liduva limo chilo twalotile dindoto, kila munu na indoto yake ivêle na mana tofauti na ya nnyake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijana yumo wa Chieblaniya, ntumishi wanga nkulu wa valinzi vako ávele pamo na hwetu nnilungu. Patunsimulidile dindoto dyetu, nang'e ánihulula kutuhaulila mana la dindoto anedyo, kila munu na indoto yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanatuhaulidile njo chiihumidile, nangu nkuuijwa mmadengo langu, na ayula nkútaleka nkulu wa mikate nkupatikwa munnandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Falao nkulaija Yusufu achemwe, bahi Yusufu nkuhumywa nnilungu upehi. Bada ya kumowa ulindo wake na kubadili dinguwo dyake, nkuhwena muyo mwanga Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao nkunnyaulila Yusufu kuchidoni, “Nangu ngùlotile indoto, henga nanga munu ahulwîle kunguhaulila mana lake. Henga ǹnipilikana imbili yako kuva wako ukàsimuliwa indoto unahulula kuhaulanga mana lake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu nkunnyang'ula Falao kuchidoni, “Nangu nikáhulula, henga Nnungu achiakwing'e lijibu limbekûva na faida kwakuwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Falao nkunnyaulila Yusufu kuchidoni, “Muindoto yangu ngúlotile nguimidìlè nnyenje muto wa Naili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkuvona ang'ombe saba vakatapêle na vanyetîle uvahuma mmuto na kulya wahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya anevo, nkuhumila na ang'ombe vanji saba vadabadênge, vahakalênge na vayandîle namene. Nangu nikánambiwahi kuvona ang'ombe vavêle na hali ibaya namuna aneyo nchilambo achino cha Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi avala ang'ombe vahakalenge na vayandîle namene nkuvalya avala ang'ombe saba vanyetîle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga pamo na kuvalya avala ang'ombe vanyetîle, wala nanga munu achichiavamale kuva vàvalile avao, kwa kuva váyandile chihi uchila muchi chivanavele patandi. Anepo nangu nkwimuka nnuwono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo nangu nkulota indoto inji, na muindoto aneyo ngúlawene mahahi saba lakatapêle, laumbalidîle ngano ulahipuka nnupambahi lumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya anelo nkuhipuka mahahi lanji saba lakávele na ngano nkati mwake, lachapakêle, layumîjwe na lipungo livêle na chitukuta namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Àlalá mahahi saba lachapakêle nkulamila àlalá mahahi saba lakatapêle. Bahi nangu nkuvasimulila ahavi dindoto anedyo, henga nanga munu ahulwîle kunguhaulila mana lake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Yusufu nkunnyaulila Falao kuchidoni, “Dindoto dyako dyammalele dìvele chihi na mana imo bahi. Nnungu àkuhunukulidile mambo lambelatenda mmaduva ulola laîda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avala ang'ombe saba vakatapêle ni vyaka saba, na àlalá mahahi saba lakatapêle nni vyaka saba. Dindoto anedyo dìvele chihi na mana imo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avala ang'ombe saba vayandîle namene vanahumidile bada ya avala vanyetîle, na àlalá mahahi saba lakávele na chinu, layumîjwe na lipungo livêle na chitukuta namene, mana lake ni myaka saba ya indala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nfalume, malinga chinikuhaulidile kuva, Nnungu àkuhunukulidile mambo lambelatenda mmaduva ulola laîda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pàmbekuva na vyaka saba vya indimbu ya vilyo nchilambo chammalele cha ku Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga bada ya anepo, vìmbekwida vyaka vinji saba vya indala, mpaka aneyo indimbu ìmbeluvalika mwalehu. Indala aneyo ìmbechondonganga chilambo achino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indimbu aneyo ìmbeluvalika mwalehu ing'anya indala imbekwîda ìmbeyoha namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indoto yako íliuyidile myanda mivili kwa mifano ilandâna kumaiha kuva, Nnungu ànikudungila, na àmbetenda chinu anecho mmaduva ulola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi vino wako nfalume, ùlembelewa untandole munu avêle na ding'ano na lúnda uchinga un'juhe kuva nkwímilila wa chilambo chammalele cha ku Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchocho, ùlembelewa uvatandole vakwímilila nchilambo achino koka uvalaije valapole asilimiya ishilini ya vilyo vyammalele vya Misili muvyaka avino saba ya indimbu ya vilyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvalaije vakwímilila anevo valapole vilyo anevyo vyammalele muvyaka saba viîda vya indimbu ya vilyo. Na vavichunge vilyo anevyo n'dimanga dyammalele kwa amuli yako nfalume uchinga vanu va dimanga anedyo vààve na akiba ya vilyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilyo anevyo vìmbekuva akiba kwajili ya chilambo cha Misili uchinga chinaondongwe ing'anya ya myaka saba iîda ya indala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yusufu àjuhwa kuva nkulu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ushauli anewo wauhumije Yusufu nkwonekana kuva wambone muyo mwanga Falao na kwa maafisa vake vammalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Falao nkuvauja maafisa vake kuchidoni, “Ayu munu àvele na Umumu wa Nnungu. Dachi, tuchituhulule kumpata munu yunji malinga ayu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Falao nkunnyaulila Yusufu kuchidoni, “Kwa kuva, Nnungu ànikuhunukulila mambo alano lammalele, nanga munu yunji avêle na ding'ano na lúnda muchi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wako njo umbechiimilila chilambo changu, na vanu vangu vammalele vàmbekuva mumamulaka lako. Nangu weka njo nkulu ukupunda wako, kwa kuva nangu njo nfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi vino nìkutandola kuva nkulungwa wa chilambo chammalele cha Misili!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Falao nkuula pete yake ivêle na muhuli wake nkummwaja Yusufu. Nkummwaja na dinguwo dya kung'anyima namene na nkufu wa zahabu pang'ulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao nkunkweja Yusufu munkokoteni uutângwa na falasi ukatapajîjwe kwajili ya kuikala munu wa nafasi yavili muufalume wake, na valinzi nkulongolela muyo mwanga Yusufu uvanonoha lidi uvachidoni, “Tindivalanga malundi!” Bahi namuna aneyo njo Falao champele Yusufu mamulaka makulu nchilambo chammalele cha Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamo na anelo, Falao nkunnyaulila Yusufu kuchidoni, “Nangu njo nfalume wa Misili! Ngùhaula kuva, munu woheyo wa nchilambo chammalele cha Misili anatende chinu chohecho bila luhusa lwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao nkumwing'a Yusufu lina lya Chimisili, Safenasi-Panea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:45",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Safenasi-Panea, ìnahululika kuva na mana la “Nnungu ànatangola.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uchocho, nkumwing'a Yusufu mwali wanga Potifela, uvanchema Asenasi uchinga ààve n'jawe. Potifela ávele kuhani wa milungu yao wa imanga ya Oni. Bahi Yusufu nkutandilika kuongela chilambo chammalele cha ku Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu ávele na vyaka salasini patandilike kuntumikila Falao, nfalume wa ku Misili. Yusufu nkuuka paing'ande ya nfalume, nkwonga nchilambo chammalele cha Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na muvyaka avila saba vya indimbu ya vilyo, mawelu la ku Misili nkuva na vilyo vyohe namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yusufu nkulapola vilyo anevyo vyammalele, nkuvikondya n'dimanga dya ku Misili. N'dimanga dyammalele nkukondya akiba ya vilyo vichihaloka mmawelu lavêle pepi na dimanga anedyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu nkukondya akiba ya vilyo vyohe namene. Na vilyo anevyo vyavele vyohe namene muchi ulongo wa kubahali, nkuleka kuvalanga kwa kuva vikáchivalangika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabla vikànambitandilika vyaka saba vya indala, Yusufu ávele na vana vavili vanammelekedile Asenasi n'jawe, mwali wanga Potifela kuhani wa imanga ya Oni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu nkunchema mwanawe wachilume, chihungula mikova lina lyake Manase",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:51",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lidi lya lina Manase, lìpilikanika muchi lilove lya Chieblaniya livêle na mana ya “kuluvalila.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wachidoni, “Nnungu àngutendile nguluvalile ibaniki yangu yammalele na nivaluvalile vanu vammalele va muing'ande ya atatangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanawe wavili wachilume nkunchema lina Efulaimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:52",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lidi lya lina Efulaimu, lìpilikanika muchi lilove lya Chieblaniya livêle na mana ya “kupa vihepo myanda mivili.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wachidoni, “Nnungu àning'ile vana nchilambo cha ibaniki yangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aila myaka saba ya indimbu ya vilyo nchilambo cha Misili nkupita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkutandilika myaka saba ya indala malinga chanahawile Yusufu anepo patandi. Vilambo vyammalele nkuva na indala, henga chilambo chammalele cha ku Misili chívele na vilyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vanu vammalele va nchilambo chammalele cha ku Misili pavatandilike kuyona indala, nkunkutila Falao aveng'e vilyo. Nang'e nkuvahaulila Vamisili vammalele kuchidoni, “Hweneng'ana kwanga Yusufu, koka mutende achila chambennyaulilanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuva indala ívele ing'ali na íniyanjala nchilambo chammalele, bahi Yusufu nkuchimula magala lammalele, nkuvasumisa Vamisili vilyo. ",
          "type": "text",
